**Title:** Whispering Waves and Quiet Courage

**Description:** Drift into a serene slumber as you journey alongside Ben, an eleven-year-old with a heart full of quiet bravery, and his playful otter companion, Ollie. In this tranquil sleep story, the duo explores the calming expanse of a coastal shoreline, where the golden glow of a setting sun kisses the sandy beach and gentle waves lull them into a state of peaceful wonder. Listen as Ben discovers the beauty in subtle whispers of the natural world, fostering a deep sense of connection and courage. Designed to reduce anxiety and foster emotional calm, this audio experience invites you to find peace in the rhythmic embrace of the ocean’s lullaby, leading you gently into restful sleep.

